TITLE:: SCVTheme
summary:: Theme engine and immutable palette definitions for SCVisuals
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/SCVisuals, Classes/SCVMeasurementBroker

DESCRIPTION::
SCVTheme defines the color palettes, densities, and performance presets for SCVisuals instruments. Themes are treated as pure data: changing themes or densities never reallocates audio synths, buffers, or FFT chains.

Six default themes are provided:
list::
## strong::\graphite:: (default dark slate theme)
## strong::\phosphor:: (classic terminal / vintage green theme)
## strong::\ice:: (high-contrast cool blue theme)
## strong::\amber:: (warm CRT glow theme)
## strong::\paper:: (light background studio drafting theme)
## strong::\monochrome:: (grayscale minimalist theme)
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: get
Returns the theme associated with the given name (or the default if not found).

METHOD:: current
Returns the current active theme.

METHOD:: current
Sets the active theme.

METHOD:: register
Registers a new custom theme dictionary.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: density
Current density: code::\micro::, code::\compact::, or code::\extended::.

METHOD:: withDensity
Returns a new theme instance with the requested density without mutating the original.

METHOD:: withPreset
Returns a new theme instance with the requested performance preset (code::\eco::, code::\normal::, or code::\detailed::).

METHOD:: copy
Returns a new copy of the theme with optional property overrides.
